Junos OS: 23.2R2-S7, 23.4R2-S7, 24.2R2, 24.4R1-S2, 24.4R2, 25.2R1, and all subsequent releases;
Junos OS Evolved: 23.2R2-S7-EVO, 23.4R2-S8-EVO, 24.2R2-EVO, 24.4R1-S3-EVO, 24.4R2-EVO, 25.2R1-EVO, and all subsequent releases.
